WEBVTT

00:00:06.340 --> 00:00:09.365
Good evening, and welcome to Nordic Crypto.

00:00:09.365 --> 00:00:16.898
This is issue number one, with the Nordic crypto news that
mattered from the 27th of September to the 2nd of October,

00:00:16.898 --> 00:00:17.220
2026.

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:22.741
Tonight: Binance under scrutiny over Europe's new crypto
rules.

00:00:22.741 --> 00:00:27.006
Sweden's financial watchdog issues a crypto sanctions
warning.

00:00:27.006 --> 00:00:30.009
And the meetups coming up across the region.

00:00:30.009 --> 00:00:37.531
Nordic Crypto gathers crypto, bitcoin and blockchain news
from Norway, Sweden, Denmark, Finland and Iceland, with a

00:00:37.531 --> 00:00:39.494
link to every original source.

00:00:42.420 --> 00:00:44.599
Our top story tonight.

00:00:44.599 --> 00:00:51.171
Binance is under investigation for allegedly offering
services in Europe without the licence required under the

00:00:51.171 --> 00:00:53.362
EU's new crypto rules, known as MiCA.

00:00:53.362 --> 00:00:55.849
That's from Realtid in Sweden.

00:00:56.784 --> 00:01:03.657
Dagens PS, also in Sweden, reports that Binance said it
would leave Europe, but customers are still trading.

00:01:03.657 --> 00:01:07.223
EU financial authorities now want to know how.

00:01:10.172 --> 00:01:16.306
Realtid reports that Sweden's financial watchdog says
crypto-assets and illegal financial networks pose the

00:01:16.306 --> 00:01:20.318
biggest risk of Iran and North Korea dodging sanctions
through Sweden.

00:01:21.200 --> 00:01:27.889
Finansinspektionen's new risk assessment finds that weapons
of mass destruction are most likely to be financed through

00:01:27.889 --> 00:01:30.439
illegal financial activity and crypto-assets.

00:01:33.340 --> 00:01:40.728
Kaupr reports that GreenMerc is cutting costs by 4.8 million
Swedish kronor a year while Northcrypto turns a profit, with

00:01:40.728 --> 00:01:43.841
spending redirected to the banking offer Trijo One.

00:01:44.728 --> 00:01:51.957
In Norway, Finansavisen writes that Joakim Hannisdahl's new
crypto fund, built on a model that did well in backtesting,

00:01:51.957 --> 00:01:54.690
is up 39 percent since it launched in August.

00:01:55.588 --> 00:02:02.180
And from Yle in Finland: at a Finnish crypto event,
investors said community and technology are what draw them

00:02:02.180 --> 00:02:04.337
to crypto, as bitcoin rallied again.

00:02:07.224 --> 00:02:14.354
In Norway, three Norwegians and a Swede have been charged in
a large drug case with links abroad, involving drug sales on

00:02:14.354 --> 00:02:16.720
the dark web, paid for in cryptocurrency.

00:02:16.720 --> 00:02:21.560
That's according to the Southern Norway public prosecutor,
via Aftenposten.

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:28.344
And in Lund, Sydsvenskan reports that three teenagers have
been arrested on suspicion of kidnapping.

00:02:28.344 --> 00:02:33.000
They are suspected of tying up a local man with duct tape to
rob him of crypto.

00:02:35.936 --> 00:02:42.245
On the 8th of October, it's Göteborg Bitcoin Meetup number
49, at Ölrepubliken in Gothenburg.

00:02:42.245 --> 00:02:48.103
On the 14th, Crypto killer apps, at Polyteknisk Forening in
Oslo, with paid entry.

00:02:48.103 --> 00:02:52.576
On the 15th, the Uppsala Bitcoin Meetup, at Café Årummet.

00:02:52.576 --> 00:02:57.209
And on the 28th of October, Oslo Blockchain Meetup, on Nexa.

00:02:57.209 --> 00:03:04.656
A disclosure: Jørgen, who runs Nordic Crypto, is the
speaker, runs this meetup, and works on Nexa at Bitcoin

00:03:04.656 --> 00:03:05.346
Unlimited.

00:03:05.346 --> 00:03:10.505
More events, including Stockholm and Helsinki in November,
are in the calendar.

00:03:11.444 --> 00:03:14.261
And that's Nordic Crypto for this week.

00:03:14.261 --> 00:03:20.266
All the stories, the events calendar and a who's who of
Nordic crypto are on the Nordic Crypto website.

00:03:20.266 --> 00:03:24.702
If you spot a mistake, or a story we missed, use the tip
form.

00:03:24.702 --> 00:03:27.606
Nothing here is investment advice.

00:03:27.606 --> 00:03:29.494
Until next week.

00:03:29.494 --> 00:03:31.724
The Nordic Crypto team.

00:03:31.724 --> 00:03:33.182
Good night.
